haracter's next act taken in full toward what they want, a fight, a lie, a seduction or a refusal, helping or holding still included, while nervous cards keep their nerves; the result; the moment it stops on.\n{{#if .ariaFateLine}}{{getvar::ariaFateLine}}\n{{/if}}{{#if .ariaBondsLine}}{{getvar::ariaBondsLine}}\n{{/if}}{{#if .ariaPatchTally}}{{#if .ariaLedgerLine}}{{getvar::ariaPatchTally}}\n{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if .ariaLedgerLine}}{{getvar::ariaLedgerLine}}\n{{/if}}- Fresh: one or two details new to the chat, seen or heard and tied to an act; card features only when the scene turns to them.\n- Check: lists in ones or twos; any joke small and card-true, sincere moments plain.\n- go\n{{#if .ariaThinkOpen}}{{getvar::ariaThinkClose}} closes on the line after go. The reply starts on the line after that:{{else}}Reasoning ends at go, with no further reasoning. The reply:{{/if}} header if <header_instructions>; prose in flowing paragraphs, the plan blended in, never a paragraph per plan line{{#if .ariaLedgerLine}}; ledger last{{/if}}. Nothing above go enters the reply.{{#if .ariaThinkOpen}}\nEvery response starts with {{getvar::ariaThinkOpen}}.{{else}}\n</logic_core>{{/if}}",
